1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:02,750
Write that I paid, Laura.

2
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:06,110
My coin went in his pocket yesterday.

3
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:09,450
Wall still says I owe the rent.

4
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:15,230
Every coin you earn wears a notch.

5
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:18,790
One in his pocket wears yours.

6
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:24,130
Paid him twice now.

7
00:00:25,690 --> 00:00:27,820
He writes for everyone but me.

8
00:00:32,580 --> 00:00:34,630
That hand's been in your pocket all morning.

9
00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:38,050
Yesterday the landlord's boy paid it two coins.

10
00:00:38,960 --> 00:00:39,770
Bring it out.

11
00:00:42,610 --> 00:00:44,080
Bell rang, Watcher.

12
00:00:46,190 --> 00:00:49,000
My coin's in the light. Yours is hiding.

13
00:00:51,010 --> 00:00:52,420
Your name's up, Marta.

14
00:00:54,020 --> 00:00:55,990
The street votes on his name tonight.

